Description: Add contrast autofocus to the Software ISP and Simple Pipeline
 Gather central RAW green-channel contrast and scene distribution, control
 the associated lens with write acknowledgements, and implement triggered
 and continuous autofocus with pause controls and AF metadata. Use capture
 timestamps to exclude old frames after lens movement and preserve initial
 application controls.
